title: OrrinFirst
---
Orrin: Sorrel's missed three deliveries, Vosk. Their last telemetry says the drill is still turning. #emotion:Worried
Taren: A drill that runs for three cycles and never orders a part. Somebody down there is busy. #emotion:Curious
Orrin: Find the outpost crew. Whatever's keeping them from answering, shut it down. #emotion:Determined
<<startQuest Sorrel>>
Sela: "Whatever." Very thorough briefing. I'm coming. #emotion:Amused
Taren: I'd already counted you in. #emotion:Happy
<<joinParty Sela>>
Orrin: Launch from any airlock. Sorrel's east of the ring. Grab the drill's survey key too. Ours doesn't match the Gullet anymore, and that's the only road to Tallow. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: OrrinRepeat
---
Orrin: Outpost first, then the drill. And if Sela ever goes quiet, run. #emotion:Smug
===
title: OrrinPost
---
Orrin: The drill's gone quiet. First time in a month that silence counts as good news. #emotion:Tender
Orrin: That key reads like a route, but routes have been moving. Don't fly it to Tallow until Sela's had a look. #emotion:Worried
===
title: MiraFirst
---
Mira: Two Shapers. Twice the damage to my stock and half the patience. #emotion:Amused
Mira: Bring me six Ridge Crystals from Sorrel and I'll make it worth the trip. Bright seams only. Don't lick them. #emotion:Happy
<<startQuest MiraCrystals>>
-> Show us the stock.
    <<shop>>
-> We'll bring the crystals.
    Mira: Then I'll pretend that was a promise. #emotion:Smug
===
title: MiraRepeat
---
Mira: If it sparks, I sell it. If it smokes, Hal's down the corridor. #emotion:Happy
<<shop>>
===
title: MiraPost
---
Mira: Six clean crystals. Every colour I asked for, including "not stolen". #emotion:Happy
<<shop>>
===
title: HalFirst
---
Hal: Hold still a moment. Your collar node's running warm. #emotion:Worried
Taren: It does that whenever someone tells me to hold still. #emotion:Amused
Hal: Here's alloy and filament for a first part. Forge three edges on that bench and it'll show you the refined pattern. #emotion:Tender
<<giveItem ScrapAlloy 12>>
<<giveItem LatticeFilament 3>>
<<setFlag hal.lesson>>
-> Use the fabrication bench.
    <<bench>>
-> Repair and save.
    <<repair>>
-> Just visiting.
    Hal: Good. Do that more often. #emotion:Happy
===
title: HalRepeat
---
Hal: I can mend a body. A hurry's harder to fix. #emotion:Neutral
-> Repair and save.
    <<repair>>
-> Use the bench.
    <<bench>>
-> Leave.
    Hal: Easy on the landing. #emotion:Tender
===
title: HalPost
---
Hal: Orrin's board says the drill's quiet. So does your collar node. Thank you. #emotion:Happy
-> Repair and save.
    <<repair>>
-> Use the bench.
    <<bench>>
-> Leave.
    Hal: Easy on the landing. #emotion:Tender
===
title: SelaWaiting
---
Sela: Orrin has the coordinates, and I have several unreasonable ideas. See him first. #emotion:Playful
===
title: SelaWalkwayRepair
---
Taren: Mira. The yellow line is where the stall stops. #emotion:Neutral
Mira: It did stop. Then the pears needed room. #emotion:Smug
Taren: And I need room to close this cover without pinching the conduit. #emotion:Determined
Sela: Does your repair come with a ship? I've got a receipt for one that left an hour ago. #emotion:Worried
Mira: Well, the receipt was on time. #emotion:Amused
Sela: I chart routes for a living. Docks are harder. Here, I'll hold this side. #emotion:Playful
Taren: Keep the hinge clear. There. Now it'll sit flush. #emotion:Determined
<<stationShift>>
Mira: Did the walkway just move? #emotion:Shocked
Taren: A little. I hadn't tightened that joint yet. #emotion:Worried
Sela: Both sides moved. Together. #emotion:Curious
Mira: Then my stall's still on its side of the line. Open the walkway before the pears bruise. #emotion:Amused
Taren: All right. Orrin's been waiting for us. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: OrrinOpening
---
Orrin: Not yet, Taren. Half my morning's stuck on the far side of that walkway. #emotion:Neutral
Orrin: Close the cover and open the gates. Then come and see me about Sorrel. #emotion:Determined
===
title: MiraOpening
---
Mira: The stall isn't on your line. Your line is under my stall. Different thing. #emotion:Smug
Mira: Shut that cover so I can open. The pears keep a schedule, even if your walkway doesn't. #emotion:Amused
===
title: SelaOpening
---
Sela: Is this walkway closed, or just resting? #emotion:Curious
Taren: Closed until I finish the cover. Give me a minute. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: OrrinBerth
---
Orrin: Oda's token? It'll be under the evacuation notices. Everything's under the evacuation notices. #emotion:Neutral
Orrin: Stamped. One family, one berth, one harbour. The Compact likes things it can count. #emotion:Worried
Taren: You don't sound sure. #emotion:Curious
Orrin: I'm sure of the arithmetic. Take it to her. #emotion:Neutral
<<setFlag oda.tokenCollected>>
===
title: OrrinAfterCantor
---
Orrin: Back from Tallow? Then the Gullet's a road again. I'll put that on the board, and nobody will believe it. #emotion:Amused
===
